                "headline": "Extreme Heat Warning issued October 3 at 12:15PM PDT until October 8 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Los Angeles/Oxnard CA",
                "description": "* WHAT...Dangerously hot conditions with temperatures up to 90 at the\ncoast and 105 in the valleys.\n\n* WHERE...Coast and valleys of Los Angeles and Ventura Counties.\n\n* WHEN...Until 8 PM PDT Thursday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Heat related illnesses increase significantly during\nextreme heat events.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Very hot temperatures are likely to continue\ninto the second week of October, possibly requiring an extension of\nthis product.",
                "instruction": "Drink plenty of fluids, stay in an air-conditioned room, stay out of\nthe sun, and check up on relatives and neighbors.",
